e the base. It then formed a base for about 6 weeks, peaking at $117.77 and pulling back 13% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Dec 23, 2020 it closed at $118.14, its first close above the base high of $117.77. Volume that day was 962K shares, 0.49x the prior 10-day average of 2.0M. It never committed. The best close afterward was $122.81, within 5% of the level, and the chart ends at $119.09.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that never resolved. Price chopped around the level without committing either way. Sitting it out, or getting out flat, was a fine read."}}